  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2022-04-22T17:00:00-04:00\" title=\"Friday, April 22, 2022, 5:00 pm\">April 22, 2022</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"em em-view-container\" id=\"em-view-6\">\n\t<div class=\"em pixelbones em-item em-item-single em-event em-event-single em-event-271 \" id=\"em-event-6\">\n\t\t<div></div>\n<p>\n\t<strong>Date/Time</strong><br />\n\tDate(s) - 04/22/2022<br /><i>5:00 pm - 7:00 pm</i>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<strong>Categories</strong>\n\t\t</p><ul class=\"event-categories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/archive/source-8a5017c3925316ae76c6/\">Special Event</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\n<p></p>\n<br />\n<p>Spring is in the air!  The new season brings with it increased activity in preparation of upcoming Guild events. On Friday, April 22, 5-7pm, the Cape Cod Cooperative Bank in <b>Harwich </b>is hosting an after-hours public reception featuring the Guild of Harwich Artists works. <strong>Sedona Summer</strong> is encouraging members to bring a painting with a table or floor easel by 4:45 pm. <b> Light refreshments will be served.</b></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignleft\" src=\"/media/archive/bc24bad844be4f19bcc6cb944b0c192419ad726d2b403d045342ad56208278ab.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"413\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img class=\" wp-image-6099 alignright\" src=\"/media/archive/9bc01157649ede535673f0e38db10d423956809ff9396cf5cb8d63e9a61cd129.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"324\" height=\"324\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
